******************************** Data Format ***********************************

Column 01: Month
Column 02: Hour
Column 03: Frequency (MHz)
Column 04: D - Path distance (km)
Column 05: Pr - Median receiver power (dB)
Column 06: SNR - Median signal-to-noise ratio (dB)
Column 07: BCR - Basic circuit reliability (%)
Column 08: OCR - Overall circuit reliability not considering scattering (%)
Column 09: OCRs - Overall circuit reliability considering scattering (%)
Column 10: Probocc - Probability of scattering (%)
Column 11: MIR - Multimode Interference (%)

************************** End Data Format ********************************

